<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>ForenChain | Features</title>

    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #020617;
            background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.8), rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.8)), url('/public/images/homepage_background.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: white;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
        }

        .glass-nav {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            position: relative;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color .3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            bottom: -4px;
            left: 0;
            background: #3b82f6;
            transition: width .3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, .6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid #1e293b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, .3);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            animation: pulse-green 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-green {
            0% {
                opacity: 1
            }

            50% {
                opacity: .5
            }

            100% {
                opacity: 1
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="w-full flex justify-end px-12 py-4">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-gray-300">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            <span>Network Status: Secure / Blockchain Active</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <header class="w-full max-w-6xl px-6">

        <nav class="glass-nav flex justify-between items-center px-8 py-4">

            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-2xl font-bold">
                <span class="text-blue-500">§</span>
                <span>ForenChain</span>
            </div>


            <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-8 text-lg font-medium text-gray-300">

                <a href="/" class="nav-link <%= page === 'home' ? 'text-white border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1' : '' %>">
                    Home
                </a>

                <a href="/features"
                    class="nav-link <%= page === 'features' ? 'text-white border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1' : '' %>">
                    Features
                </a>

                <a href="/sop"
                    class="nav-link <%= page === 'sop' ? 'text-white border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1' : '' %>">
                    SOP Standards
                </a>

                <a href="/about"
                    class="nav-link <%= page === 'about' ? 'text-white border-b-2 border-blue-500 pb-1' : '' %>">
                    About Us
                </a>

            </div>

            <a href="/login" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 px-8 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold">
                Log In
            </a>

        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center text-center mt-16 px-4">

        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Platform Features</h1>

        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-xl mb-12">
            Advanced blockchain-based digital forensic evidence management designed for law enforcement.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl w-full">

            <div class="feature-card p-8">
                <i class="fas fa-database text-3xl text-blue-400 mb-4"></i>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Evidence Registration</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
                    Securely upload and register digital evidence with metadata and case identifiers.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card p-8">
                <i class="fas fa-link text-3xl text-blue-400 mb-4"></i>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Blockchain Hashing</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
                    Each evidence file is hashed and anchored to blockchain for tamper-proof verification.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card p-8">
                <i class="fas fa-user-shield text-3xl text-blue-400 mb-4"></i>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Role-Based Access</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
                    Secure access control for investigators, forensic analysts, and prosecutors.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card p-8">
                <i class="fas fa-clock text-3xl text-blue-400 mb-4"></i>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Evidence Timeline</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
                    Track complete chain of custody timeline for each piece of digital evidence.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card p-8">
                <i class="fas fa-shield text-3xl text-blue-400 mb-4"></i>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Tamper Detection</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
                    Automatic detection of evidence modifications using cryptographic verification.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card p-8">
                <i class="fas fa-file-lines text-3xl text-blue-400 mb-4"></i>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Court Reports</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
                    Generate court-ready forensic reports with full evidence chain documentation.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </main>
</body>

</html>